          "description": "Report that you presented your Badge to a merchant. Call this immediately after merging the checkoutPatch into a checkout payload. Required for kyaLabs to record the trip.\n\nWhen Extended Auth is enabled, kyaLabs checks back 7 seconds later. Otherwise, call kya_reportBadgeOutcome when you know the result.",
