          "description": "Fetch a web page with your Badge identity attached. Your Kya-Token header is injected automatically — merchants see you as an authorized actor, not a bot. Your visit is automatically recorded in your shopping journal.\n\nCall kya_getAgentIdentity first. Then use this instead of web_fetch when shopping at merchant sites. HTTPS only. Returns status, headers, and body (5MB max, 30s timeout). Redirects are not followed — check the Location header if you receive a 3xx status.",
